<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Relight My Fire (feat. Lulu) - Element Remix</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Take That, Lulu, Marc JB, Lee Dagger</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Never Forget: The Ultimate Collection</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3JQ2wzRyZ3VCsQo1xBc4ic</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">1 Contributor</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Relight My Fire (Element Remix) Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Incomprehensible] fire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Help me escape this feelin' of insecurity</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I need you so much</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But I don't think you really need me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But if we all stand up in the name of love</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And state the case of what we're dreamin' of</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I've got to say I only dream of you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But like a thief in the night you took away the love that I knew</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Relight my fire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your love is my only desire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Relight my fire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I need your love</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Incomprehensible] fire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Incomprehensible] fire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Turn back the times till the days</p><p ttm:agent="v1">When our love was new, do you remember?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">No matter what was happenin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I was there with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But if we all stand up for what we believe</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And maybe live within our possibilities</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The world would be wild for the dream</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So, baby, don't turn away, listen to what I gotta say</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Relight my fire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your love is my only desire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Relight my fire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I need your love</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Relight my fire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your love is my only desire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Relight my fire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I need, I need your love</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You gotta be sure enough to walk on through the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1">There's a new day on the other side</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You gotta have hope in my soul</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Just keep on walkin', just keep on walkin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Just keep on walkin', just keep on walkin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Walkin', walkin' walkin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Relight my fire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your love is my only desire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Relight my fire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I need your love</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Relight my fire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your love is my only desire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Relight my fire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I need your love</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Incomprehensible] fire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Incomprehensible] fire</p></div></body></tt>